{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18419","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 陈羽","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宛宛如丝柳，含黄一望新。\n未成沟上暗，且向日边春。\n嫋娜方遮水，低迷欲醉人。\n托空芳郁郁，逐溜影鳞鳞。\n弄水滋宵露，垂枝染夕尘。\n夹堤连太液，还似映天津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}